WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.025
Check yourself with two questions.

2
00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:07.000
First: a finding failed last month, and
this month it's skipped, disconnected.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:07.800
What is it?

4
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.813
The answer is b: no longer evaluated.

5
00:00:10.813 --> 00:00:12.050
It's not fixed.

6
00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:14.537
Fix the run's connection,
and run it again.

7
00:00:14.537 --> 00:00:18.824
Second: a Security Hub control
reports passed at the account level.

8
00:00:18.824 --> 00:00:19.962
What should you check?

9
00:00:19.962 --> 00:00:24.357
The answer is b: whether any
resource corresponds to the control,

10
00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:28.337
because AWS produces an
account-level pass when none does.

11
00:00:28.337 --> 00:00:30.837
Read the pass with the resource inventory.

12
00:00:30.837 --> 00:00:35.810
The module page has three more questions,
each linked to the unit that answers it.
